help.support.contact.body:
Email us at [{email}](mailto:{email}). If you can, write from the email address on your Mahaam account, and tell us:

- what you were trying to do, and what happened instead;
- which app you were using (web, iPhone or iPad, Android, desktop or the browser extension) and its version;
- a screenshot, if you have one.

**Never send us your password, recovery codes or access tokens.** We will never ask for them.

When you're signed in on the web, you can also choose **Report a problem** in your account menu. The report reaches the team with the page you were on and the technical details that help us find the problem.
